      "content": "thanks for that. i checked the soil and it feels pretty damp even though it's been a few days since the last time i watered. i also noticed some weird little spots on the undersides of the leaves that look almost like tiny bite marks or something. do you think it could be bugs? what kind of pests should i be looking out for?",
