      "content": "spider mites, wow okay. it's just so frustrating because i feel like i've been doing everything right. the plant just seems to be getting worse despite my best efforts. i've been trying to keep it in a good spot with light and everything, but it's like there's some invisible thing working against me. is there anything else that could be causing this kind of sudden decline or just sabotaging it?",
